    "answer": "The root cause was a bug in edge-sw-7's switch firmware 1.2.3: under high multicast load, proxy ARP incorrectly advertised VPN-assigned addresses (including addresses outside the local subnet). Those bogus ARP replies introduced a second MAC/IP mapping on the campus L2 network, creating ephemeral duplicate-IP conflicts, misrouting, VPN rekeys, and 30–90 second traffic blackholes.",
